## 🤖 STANDARDIZED COMMANDS

### Initialization Commands
```
@ai read-methodology
@ai check-status
@ai read-domain [domain]
@ai read-version [version]
```

### Implementation Commands
```
@ai implement [domain] [feature]
@ai create-component [domain] [component]
@ai create-service [domain] [service]
@ai create-tests [component]
```

### Synchronization Commands
```
@ai update-dashboard [task-id] [status]
@ai sync-domain [domain]
@ai check-consistency [scope]
@ai update-docs [section]
```

### Task Commands
```
@ai create-task [domain] [title] [description]
@ai update-task [task-id] [field] [value]
@ai complete-task [task-id] [notes]
@ai list-tasks [filter]
@ai sync-all-versions
@ai sync-version [version]
@ai validate-dependencies
@ai update-metrics [metric] [value]
@ai sync-educational-version [version]
@ai sync-educational-gaming [version]
@ai validate-educational-dependencies
@ai update-educational-metrics
```

## 📋 CHAT TEMPLATE (MANDATORY)

When starting any new chat, ALWAYS use this template:

```markdown
# [TASK-XXX] Task Title

## 📋 Task Information
- **ID**: TASK-XXX
- **Domain**: [education | gaming | blockchain | user-management | marketplace | analytics | development]
- **Version**: [V1.0 | V2.0 | V3.0 | V4.0]
- **Priority**: [High | Medium | Low]
- **Responsible**: Cursor AI
- **Start Date**: [DD/MM/YYYY]
- **Deadline**: [DD/MM/YYYY]

## 🎯 Objective
[Clear and specific description of the task objective]

## 📚 Mandatory References
- **Methodology**: [CURSOR-METHODOLOGY.md](CURSOR-METHODOLOGY.md)
- **Commands**: [CURSOR-COMMANDS.md](CURSOR-COMMANDS.md)
- **Dashboard**: [PROGRESS-DASHBOARD.md](PROGRESS-DASHBOARD.md)
- **Domain**: [DOMAINS/[domain]/README.md](DOMAINS/[domain]/README.md)
- **Version**: [VERSIONS/[version]/README.md](VERSIONS/[version]/README.md)

## ✅ Initialization Checklist
- [ ] Read Cursor methodology
- [ ] Consulted progress dashboard
- [ ] Checked relevant domain
- [ ] Confirmed product version
- [ ] Understood task objective
- [ ] Executed mandatory commands

## 🔍 Task Analysis
[Detailed analysis of the task]

## 🛠️ Implementation
[Implementation details]

## ✅ Completion
[Completion and synchronization]
```

## 🚨 MANDATORY WORKFLOW

### Step 1: Initialization (ALWAYS REQUIRED)
1. Read `docs/CURSOR-SYSTEM.md`
2. Read `docs/PROGRESS-DASHBOARD.md`
3. Read relevant domain documentation
4. Read relevant version documentation
5. Use the chat template above

### Step 2: Implementation
1. Follow DDD principles
2. Use standardized commands
3. Create tests for all code
4. Update documentation
5. Maintain consistency

### Step 3: Synchronization (ALWAYS REQUIRED)
1. Update `docs/PROGRESS-DASHBOARD.md`
2. Update domain documentation
3. Update version documentation
4. Check consistency across domains
5. Verify all changes are documented

